dien.com/2026/07/19/echange-guillaume-ngefa-parlementaires-grand-equateur/","title":"Justice au Grand Équateur : Guillaume Ngefa saisi des blocages judiciaires et sécuritaires","publisher":"Congo Quotidien","date":"2026-07-19"},"35":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bolomba_Territory","title":"Bolomba Territory","publisher":"Wikipedia"}},"units":{"CD4108-bolomba":"Bolomba territory (Equateur) lies far from the eastern and Mai-Ndombe/Kwamouth conflict zones and has no reported armed-group presence or territorial control in 2025-2026. State authority is exercised mainly through the Congolese National Police (PNC) at the territory seat Bolomba and in secteur/post centres (Mampoko, Monieka, Bokote); in July 2026 Grand Equateur MPs complained of police harassment in Bolomba, which reflects abusive but present policing rather than a challenge to state control. FARDC presence is light. Rural villages across the Bolomba, Lolanga-Mampoko and Monieka secteurs are assessed as default state (PNC) presence."}}